---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="GitHub" description="Open-source projects and GitHub activity from Arman Mishra.">
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">GITHUB / CODE & CONTRIBUTIONS</div>
    <h1>Built in the open<span class="hero-accent">Tools, experiments, and code.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Selected repositories and public development activity from my GitHub profile.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/enkidudev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit GitHub profile <span>↗</span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="github-projects">
      <article class="github-repo">
        <div class="project-meta"><span>PUBLIC REPOSITORY</span><span class="project-status">PYTHON</span></div>
        <h2>Shredder</h2>
        <p>Fast reconnaissance, service enumeration, and evidence-based triage.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/enkidudev/shredder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open repository <span>↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="github-repo">
        <div class="project-meta"><span>PUBLIC REPOSITORY</span><span class="project-status">PYTHON</span></div>
        <h2>INK</h2>
        <p>Encrypted, local-first credential and authentication-evidence notebooks with offline HTML reporting for penetration testing workflows.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/enkidudev/INK" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open repository <span>↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">PROFILE STATISTICS</div><h2>Activity at a glance.</h2></div>
      <p class="section-description">These cards are loaded from public GitHub statistics services and may occasionally be rate-limited.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="github-stats-grid">
      <div class="github-stat-image"><img src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=enkidudev&show_icons=true&hide_border=true&bg_color=10271F&title_color=A9C7A9&text_color=E8EEE8&icon_color=438166" alt="GitHub profile statistics for enkidudev" loading="lazy" data-external-image /><a href="https://github.com/enkidudev" hidden>View activity on GitHub ↗</a></div>
      <div class="github-stat-image"><img src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=enkidudev&layout=compact&hide_border=true&bg_color=10271F&title_color=A9C7A9&text_color=E8EEE8" alt="Most used programming languages on enkidudev GitHub" loading="lazy" data-external-image /><a href="https://github.com/enkidudev" hidden>View activity on GitHub ↗</a></div>
      <div class="github-stat-image github-streak"><img src="https://streak-stats.demolab.com?user=enkidudev&theme=transparent&hide_border=true&background=10271F&ring=A9C7A9&fire=B08A67&currStreakLabel=E8EEE8&sideLabels=A9B9AA&dates=8EA396" alt="GitHub contribution streak for enkidudev" loading="lazy" data-external-image /><a href="https://github.com/enkidudev" hidden>View activity on GitHub ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <p class="small-note">For the authoritative repository list and contribution history, use the <a href="https://github.com/enkidudev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub profile</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
